      "title": "Dividend of ₹1.50 announced",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹1.50 is the same as last year. Ex-date: 10th July 2026 Payment date: 23rd August 2026 Dividend yield will be 2.3%, which is higher than the industry average of 1.3%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (36% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (15% cash payout ratio). The dividend has decreased over the past 10 years, indicating a lack of growth and stability in payments. The company's earnings per share (EPS) would need to decline by 60% to shift the payout ratio to a potentially unsustainable range, which is more than the 5.3% EPS decline seen over the last 5 years.",
